@CatalogApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### List products — expect 200 with the 8 seeded products
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Get product by id — expect 200 with product 1 (Classic Mug)
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Get product by unknown id — expect 404
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/products/9999
Accept: application/json
